      "content": "<div data-contents-type=\"text\"><div class=\"fr-image\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-contents-json=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0af918ff2-99fcdd94-fd7b-4a04-8f52-8f5edef0ed9d&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:null}\" data-contents-type=\"image\"><div class=\"fe-image-inner\"><img src=\"https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0af918ff2-99fcdd94-fd7b-4a04-8f52-8f5edef0ed9d\" alt=\"announcements_EN.jpg\" class=\"fe-image\"></div></div></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Thank you, Daevas.<br><br>AION 2 is No. 1 on Steam Global Top Sellers, and No. 1 in 13 countries including United States, Germany, France, and Brazil. The AION 2 team is grateful to every player who made this happen.<br><br>A gift for the road ahead. Redeem code TAKEFLIGHTAION2 for:</div><ul><li><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Odyle Energy (Bound) x4</div></li><li><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Resurrection Spiritstone (Bound) x5</div></li><li><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Battle Enhance Scroll (Bound) x10</div></li></ul><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><div class=\"fr-image\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-contents-json=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0f47681de-c3c5d709-4b83-4237-b5d5-fe418a8e710f&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:null}\" data-contents-type=\"image\"><div class=\"fe-image-inner\"><img src=\"https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0f47681de-c3c5d709-4b83-4237-b5d5-fe418a8e710f\" alt=\"Celebration_Steam_1922x622.jpg\" class=\"fe-image\"></div></div></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><strong>How to redeem:</strong></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">In game, go to Settings &gt; Miscellaneous &gt; Account &gt; Enter Coupon, type TAKEFLIGHTAION2, and press Confirm.<br><br><strong>Coupon period:</strong></div><ul><li><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Starts: October 1, when servers come back after maintenance</div></li><li><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Ends (NA): October 13, 11:00 PM PDT</div></li><li><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Ends (EU): 14 October, 08:00 CEST</div></li></ul><div data-contents-type=\"text\">All servers. One redemption per account. Items are bound and cannot be traded.</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><div class=\"fr-image\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-contents-json=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0f2e40dc3-b03a8cba-fdb0-46b1-baaf-174f0df71b60&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:null}\" data-contents-type=\"image\"><div class=\"fe-image-inner\"><img src=\"https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0f2e40dc3-b03a8cba-fdb0-46b1-baaf-174f0df71b60\" alt=\"Bottom banner.jpg\" class=\"fe-image\"></div></div></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div>",
